operations. Scheme~\cite{ref28} achieves post-quantum
security using lattice-based constructions but incurs
higher trapdoor-generation and search costs due to lattice
sampling and matrix computations. VC-KASE~\cite{ref16}
supports verifiable conjunctive keyword search with
aggregate-key authorization; however, its search
